o/en/portugal/madeira/experiences/45871/"]], "side": "r", "o": [10, 10]}, {"day": 6, "name": "Seilbahn zum Strand Garajau", "text": "Cristo Rei. 5 € hin und zurück (nur bar), täglich 10–18 Uhr im Winter.", "x": 8.0184, "y": 1.7687, "links": [["Google Maps", "https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Cristo%20Rei%20Cablecar%20Cani%C3%A7o"]], "side": "r", "o": [20, 16]}, {"day": 6, "name": "CR7-Museum Funchal", "text": "Mo–Sa 10–18 Uhr, ca. 5 €, ca. 1 h.", "x": 6.8216, "y": 1.8837, "links": [["Museum", "https://museucr7.com/"]], "side": "l", "o": [-8, -20]}, {"day": 6, "name": "Delfine, Kajak und Coasteering", "text": "Ab Funchal, am Vormittag oder Nachmittag. Delfintour 60 € (9:00–11:30 oder 13:30–16:00), Kajak ab ca. 35 €, Coasteering 70 € (Caniçal). Delfine und Coasteering über Marlon 10 % günstiger.", "x": 5.484, "y": 1.5282, "links": [["Delfintour", "https://rota-dos-cetaceos.pt/whale-dolphin-watching/"], ["Kajak", "https://www.musement.com/uk/funchal/funchal-and-garajau-natural-reserve-kayak-and-snorkelling-tour-504382/"], ["Coasteering", "https://discoveryisland-madeira.com/tour/coasteering/"]], "side": "l", "o": [0, 0]}]}